# Periodic tasks (ed.3 6.8.2 table 62): a task with INTERVAL runs its
# programs once per interval, starting at t = 0. With a 100 ms step the
# fast program has run n + 1 times after step n, the slow one (300 ms)
# n div 3 + 1 times.
period_ms: 100
inputs:
outputs: fast_n slow_n
status: conformant
reference: IEC 61131-3 ed.3 6.8.2 (TASK INTERVAL)
---
0 => fast_n=1 slow_n=1
1 => fast_n=2 slow_n=1
2 => fast_n=3 slow_n=1
3 => fast_n=4 slow_n=2
4 => fast_n=5 slow_n=2
5 => fast_n=6 slow_n=2
6 => fast_n=7 slow_n=3
7 => fast_n=8 slow_n=3
